@startuml
title a Kafka transaction, from initialisation to commit
participant "Producer" as P
participant "Transaction coordinator" as C
participant "Partition leaders" as L
participant "__consumer_offsets" as O

P -> C : InitProducerId
C -> C : increment the epoch of this transactional.id
C --> P : the producer id and the new epoch
P -> C : AddPartitionsToTxn
C -> C : log each partition joining the transaction
P -> L : Produce, carrying the producer id, the epoch and a sequence number
P -> C : AddOffsetsToTxn
C -> C : log the offsets partition of the consumer group
P -> O : TxnOffsetCommit, the consumed offsets
P -> C : EndTxn, commit
C -> C : write PREPARE_COMMIT to the transaction log
C -> L : WriteTxnMarkers, commit
C -> O : WriteTxnMarkers, commit
C -> C : write COMMITTED to the transaction log
C --> P : the transaction is complete
@enduml
